{"book":19,"chapter":117,"context":{"chapter":117,"title":"Praise Him, All Nations","summary":"All nations and peoples are called to praise the LORD, because his steadfast love toward us is great and his faithfulness lasts forever.","background":"No title. At two verses it is the shortest psalm and the shortest chapter in the Bible. Part of the Passover Hallel. 'Merciful kindness' and 'truth' are hesed and emet, the pair God uses of himself in Exodus 34:6. Paul quotes verse 1 in Romans 15:11 to show God always intended Gentiles to praise him.","customs":[],"watchFor":["A worldwide call (v. 1) grounded in God's love for Israel (v. 2)."],"connections":["Romans 15:8-11","Exodus 34:6","Psalms 67:3"]},"verses":{"1":{"w":[["הַלְלוּ","halu","H1984","HVpv2mp","praise"],["אֶת","'et-","H853","HTo","<obj.>"],["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"],["כָּל","kol-","H3605","HNcmsc","O all"],["גּוֹיִם","goyim","H1471","HNcmpa","nations"],["שַׁבְּחוּהוּ","shabchuhu","H7623","HVpv2mp/Sp3ms","extol him"],["כָּל","kol-","H3605","HNcmsc","O all"],["הָאֻמִּים","ha'umim","H523","HTd/Ncmpa","the peoples"]],"x":[[66015004,66015004,13],[45015011,45015011,10],[19067003,19067003,9],[66005009,66005009,7],[19066001,19066001,4],[19086009,19086009,4],[19066004,19066004,3],[19148011,19148014,3],[66007009,66007010,3]],"xn":9},"2":{"w":[["כִּי","ki","H3588","HTc","for"],["גָבַר","gavar","H1396","HVqp3ms","it is strong"],["עָלֵינוּ","'aleinu","H5921","HR/Sp1bp","towards us"],["חַסְדּוֹ","chasdo","H2617","HNcmsc/Sp3ms","covenant loyalty his"],["וֶאֱמֶת","ve'emet-","H571","HC/Ncfsc","and [the] faithfulness of"],["יְהוָה","yahweh","H3068","HNpt","Yahweh"],["לְעוֹלָם","le'olam","H5769","HR/Ncmsa","[is] for ever"],["הַלְלוּ","halu-","H1984","HVpv2mp","praise"],["יָהּ","yah","H3050","HNpm","Yahweh"]],"x":[[23025001,23025001,18],[19103011,19103011,15],[19089001,19089001,11],[19100004,19100005,11],[62005006,62005006,11],[33007020,33007020,9],[43014006,43014006,9],[19085010,19085010,8],[45015008,45015009,